### Booking Platform - Sprint 1 (REST Client / VS Code)
### Base: local por defecto; cambiar por la URL de Render tras el despliegue.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### HU-001: Registro de cliente (201 + PENDING_VERIFICATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ana Maria Gomez",
  "document": "1020304050",
  "birthDate": "1995-04-12",
  "email": "ana.gomez@example.com",
  "phone": "+573001234567",
  "city": "Bogota",
  "notificationChannel": "EMAIL",
  "password": "ClaveSegura2026!"
}

### HU-001: Registro menor de edad (422 MINOR_NOT_ALLOWED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Pedro Menor",
  "document": "1099999999",
  "birthDate": "2012-01-01",
  "email": "menor@example.com",
  "phone": "+573009999999",
  "city": "Bogota",
  "notificationChannel": "EMAIL",
  "password": "ClaveSegura2026!"
}

### HU-001: Email duplicado (409 EMAIL_ALREADY_REGISTERED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Otra Persona",
  "document": "9999999998",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "email": "ana.gomez@example.com",
  "phone": "+573007654321",
  "city": "Medellin",
  "notificationChannel": "SMS",
  "password": "OtraClave2026!"
}

### HU-001: Reenviar verificacion (siempre 202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/registrations/verification-resends
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana.gomez@example.com" }

### HU-001: Confirmar email (token_hash del enlace recibido)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/registrations/email-verifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tokenHash": "PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_HASH_DEL_CORREO" }

### HU-021: Login (200 + accessToken/refreshToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana.gomez@example.com", "password": "ClaveSegura2026!" }

### HU-021: Credenciales invalidas (401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS; 5 fallos -> 429)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana.gomez@example.com", "password": "clave-incorrecta" }

### HU-021: Perfil autenticado (200; sin token -> 401 AUTH_REQUIRED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### HU-021: Logout (204; revoke del refresh token en GoTrue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### HU-021: Solicitud de recuperacion (siempre 202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-recovery-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana.gomez@example.com" }

### HU-021: Reset de contrasena (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-resets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tokenHash": "PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_HASH_DE_RECUPERACION",
  "newPassword": "NuevaClave2026!"
}

### Contrato OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### Swagger UI (navegador)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html
